---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProjectHero from '../../components/features/projects/ProjectHero.astro';
import AchievementCard from '../../components/common/AchievementCard.astro';
import MetricsTable from '../../components/common/MetricsTable.astro';
import ProjectDetailSection from '../../components/features/projects/ProjectDetailSection.astro';
import ProjectTags from '../../components/features/projects/ProjectTags.astro';

const title = 'AdvancedMD Implementation & Evolution';
const description = 'Led the selection, implementation, and continuous enhancement of AdvancedMD, transforming paper workflows into a robust, data-driven EHR ecosystem with custom SQL tools.';
const date = new Date('2017-12-01T00:00:00.000Z');
const tags = ['EHR', 'Digital Transformation', 'Automation', 'Healthcare IT', 'SQL'];
const image = '/assets/projects/advancedMD-project.png';
const canonicalUrl = 'https://blakeoxford.com/projects/advancedmd-implementation/';

const metrics = [
  {
    metric: 'Backlog Resolution',
    result: '~$100K in outstanding claims cleared',
    timeline: 'Within 6 months'
  },
  {
    metric: 'Operational Efficiency',
    result: '60% reduction in manual reconciliation',
    timeline: 'Consolidated workflows'
  },
  {
    metric: 'Reporting Efficiency',
    result: '75% reduction in monthly reporting tasks',
    timeline: 'SQL toolkit automation'
  },
  {
    metric: 'Onboarding Time',
    result: 'Reduced from 4 weeks to 1 week',
    timeline: 'Knowledge sharing system'
  }
];
---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  image={image}
  url={canonicalUrl}
  wide={true}
>
  <ProjectHero
    title={title}
    description={description}
    date={date}
    image={image}
  />

  <article class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-surface-subtle via-background to-background py-24">
    <div
      class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-grid-overlay/35 [background-size:200px_200px]"
      aria-hidden="true"
    ></div>
    <div class="layout-shell-wide relative flex flex-col gap-14">
      <ProjectDetailSection title="Background &amp; Challenge" eyebrow="Context">
        <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/78 dark:text-foreground-light/82">
          <p>
            In late 2017, fresh out of college at a 12-person startup, I was thrust into a billing meltdown: our revenue cycle partner collapsed, leaving us with paper records, unprocessed claims approaching $100K, and no internal billing expertise. We urgently needed to select and configure an EHR/Practice Management (PM) platform that could serve medical, Physical Therapy (PT), and Applied Behavior Analysis (ABA) services without disrupting daily operations.
          </p>
          <p>
            It was a true dumpster fire. Our initial rush to go-live—without comprehensive process mapping or stakeholder alignment—led to misconfigured workflows, a mounting backlog, and frustrated providers. Payroll hung in the balance, and I had no formal training in healthcare IT.
          </p>
        </div>
      </ProjectDetailSection>

      <ProjectDetailSection title="Key Achievements" eyebrow="Highlights" layout="surface">
        <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-1">
          <AchievementCard
            title="Strategic Vendor Selection"
            achievements={[
              'Orchestrated multi-day workshops with clinicians, PT therapists, and ABA staff to define critical requirements, ultimately selecting AdvancedMD for its modularity and payer integrations.'
            ]}
          />

          <AchievementCard
            title="Emergency Billing Continuity"
            achievements={[
              'Designed and deployed interim billing workflows in under 72 hours, training a contract biller on-the-fly to handle live claims.'
            ]}
          />

          <AchievementCard
            title="Deep Process Analysis"
            achievements={[
              'Self-taught BPMN to map end-to-end flows for medical, PT, and ABA services, uncovering 15+ handoff failures that were silently sabotaging operations.'
            ]}
          />

          <AchievementCard
            title="EDI &amp; Payer Integration"
            achievements={[
              'Proactively engaged Blue Cross Blue Shield EDI specialists to diagnose and fix legacy PIN and taxonomy mapping issues blocking claim submissions.'
            ]}
          />

          <AchievementCard
            title="Custom SQL Toolkit &amp; Automation"
            achievements={[
              'Developed SQL stored procedures and automation scripts to extract, transform, and load AdvancedMD data into a reporting database. Automated exception alerts and drove real-time KPIs in Power BI dashboards.'
            ]}
          />

          <AchievementCard
            title="Continuous Governance &amp; Evolution"
            achievements={[
              'Established quarterly governance reviews to align platform updates, schema migrations, and user-role refinements with evolving clinical and regulatory needs.'
            ]}
          />
        </div>
      </ProjectDetailSection>

      <ProjectDetailSection title="Journey &amp; Growth" eyebrow="How it unfolded">
        <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/78 dark:text-foreground-light/82">
          <p>
            <em>The core implementation landed within six months, but I continued leading enhancements for eight years—turning AdvancedMD into a business-critical platform.</em>
          </p>
          <ol class="space-y-3 pl-5">
            <li class="marker:text-foreground/45">
              <strong>Immersive learning:</strong> I lived in healthcare IT texts—BPMN guides, FHIR specs, revenue cycle books—and cold-emailed veteran implementers for playbooks.
            </li>
            <li class="marker:text-foreground/45">
              <strong>Owning mistakes:</strong> Missed scenarios for PT multi-code billing and ABA documentation forced daily firefighting; every failure fueled the next sprint backlog.
            </li>
            <li class="marker:text-foreground/45">
              <strong>Agile iteration:</strong> Bi-weekly configuration sprints deployed workflow tweaks and SQL refinements based on real-time user feedback.
            </li>
            <li class="marker:text-foreground/45">
              <strong>SME development:</strong> Over eight years I became the AdvancedMD subject-matter expert, leading integrations, schema upgrades, and bespoke extensions.
            </li>
            <li class="marker:text-foreground/45">
              <strong>Knowledge sharing:</strong> Built a 50+ article knowledge base, hosted trainings, and reduced onboarding time from four weeks to one.
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </ProjectDetailSection>

      <ProjectDetailSection title="Impact &amp; Results" eyebrow="Outcomes" layout="surface">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
          <MetricsTable metrics={metrics} />
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/78 dark:text-foreground-light/82">
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="mt-1 inline-flex h-2 w-2 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
              <span><strong>Scalable framework:</strong> The process-first governance model and custom tooling now underpin every digital transformation across the organization.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </ProjectDetailSection>

      <ProjectDetailSection title="Lessons &amp; Takeaways" eyebrow="What stuck" layout="surface">
        <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/78 dark:text-foreground-light/82">
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-foreground-light">Deep curiosity wins.</h3>
            <p>When you lack expertise, immerse yourself—books, forums, mentors—to build domain knowledge rapidly.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-foreground-light">Process comes first.</h3>
            <p>Skipping detailed workflow mapping leads to costly rework; invest upfront to clarify handoffs.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-foreground-light">Iterate fearlessly.</h3>
            <p>Treat failures as data; rapid sprints build trust and momentum.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-foreground-light">Share your knowledge.</h3>
            <p>Document and teach relentlessly to build organizational resilience.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-2">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-foreground-light">Prep before pre-sales.</h3>
            <p>Every new initiative starts with process maps, stakeholder interviews, and workflow analyses to scope accurately and de-risk delivery.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </ProjectDetailSection>

      <ProjectDetailSection title="Reflection" eyebrow="Personal note">
        <p class="text-base italic leading-relaxed text-foreground/78 dark:text-foreground-light/82">
          This project became my crucible—transforming chaos into a structured, evolving system and shaping my philosophy: never accept limits as given, and always strive for continual improvement.
        </p>
      </ProjectDetailSection>
    </div>
  </article>

  <ProjectTags tags={tags} />
</Layout>
